Interesting. Definitely worth finding out why. It could be because of the assumed aerosols. By default it should use run.gads to calculate this and it may be that pollution is not as bad as it used to be. See below example running your site with the GADs aerosol database being used, as in your simulation, and with aerosols for somewhere in eastern Australia where there isn't much dust/pollution in the atmosphere.
All the best,
Mike

